From 782960226520347ca001f59e66a6967af8e00a66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:12:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review completion confirmation so clean reviews close
 patch agents intentionally

Clean review results prompt the reviewed patch-agent chat for an explicit yes/no completion decision. The controller can close the feature for the terminal list while later follow-up chat reopens the same agent without changing the public DTO shape.
